title: 'Gnomon aesthetic session closed: desk, pigment set, mono spine, lively workshop, instrument CLI'
summary: |-
  The Atelier session 2026-10-15-gnomon-aesthetic is closed, which satisfies P8-D57: the aesthetic is finished before Move 1. The founder approved the direction render ("so far this looks right"). Decided:
  - colour: pigment set (six project hues as identity only; vermilion fail, amber warn and GATE, violet KNOT);
  - type: mono spine in JetBrains Mono everywhere, with Fraunces only for day titles (departs from the recommendation);
  - motion: lively workshop (spring fly-in, stamp, droop on failure, cap walk; event-only; departs from the recommendation);
  - CLI voice: instrument readout;
  - layout: desk (sessions left, chat with pinned project cards, global paper stack right, Workshop footer).

  Tokens and rules are in .atelier/design-system.yaml under gnomon:, the narrative is in .atelier/DESIGN.md, and the comp is at refs/direction.html. M1.10 contrast fixtures can now be built from these tokens.
